//vox t:vc262921 {
大佐_000: {
Fortune's rail gun packs some
power. A direct hit will kill you.
}//<ページ数変更>
大佐_000_1: {
Do not present her with a target
under any condition, stay behind
cover.
}
/*フォーチュンの持っているレールガンは
